## Test and deployment checklist

- **Power integrity:** Use separate 5V supply for servos; confirm common ground.
- **I2C scan:** `i2cdetect -y 1` shows LCD/keypad addresses; update code if different.
- **Camera indices:** Verify user camera is index 0, bottle camera index 1; adjust in code.
- **Face registration:** Test registration flow; confirm `data/users/<id>/face.jpg`.
